# People who own the areas they build.
#
# The same split as the ownership table in ARCHITECTURE.md and the team
# section in README.md, and the same split the About page shows inside the
# app. A pull request that touches an owned path asks its owner for a
# review.
#
# CODEOWNERS only takes effect for people who have write access to the
# repository, so the owner has to grant it first:
#
#   gh api -X PUT repos/alaa157/caregiver-daily-notes/collaborators/<login> \
#       -f permission=push
#
# Order matters: the last matching pattern wins, so the specific paths come
# after the broad ones.

